# Admin

No separate admin portal. Admin UI stays in this app.

The backend enforces every admin action. Hiding a control is not authorization.

Destructive actions and billing overrides stay behind the Phase 1.5 controls in `docs/ADMIN_PORTAL_SECURITY.md`: MFA or step-up, audit, session controls, rate limits, and privilege-escalation tests.

Audit success and denial: actor, action, target, capability, outcome, timestamp, IP, and correlation id. Never log passwords or tokens.

Strategy: `docs/ADMIN_ROUTES_STRATEGY.md`.
